<title>USA: Palatine, Ill., won by EVEREN Securities.</title>
<headline>Palatine, Ill., won by EVEREN Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities said it won $1 million of Palatine, Ill., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.92 percent.</p>
